[145.69976, "o", "    Create a document split job and wait for it to complete, returning the result.\r\n\r\n"]
[145.699859, "o", "    This is a convenience method that combines create() and wait_for_completion()\r\n    into a single call for the most common end-to-end workflow.\r\n\r\n    Experimental: This endpoint is not yet ready for production use and is subject\r\n"]
[145.699902, "o", "    to change at any time.\r\n\r\n    Args:\r\n"]
[145.69999, "o", "        categories: Categories to split the document into.\r\n\r\n        document_input: Document to be split.\r\n\r\n        organization_id: The organization ID to use for the split job.\r\n\r\n"]
[145.700032, "o", "        project_id: The project ID to use for the split job.\r\n\r\n"]
[145.700113, "o", "        splitting_strategy: Strategy for splitting the document.\r\n\r\n        polling_interval: Initial polling interval in seconds (default: 1.0)\r\n\r\n"]
[145.700166, "o", "        max_interval: Maximum polling interval for backoff in seconds (default: 5.0)\r\n\r\n"]
[145.700247, "o", "        timeout: Maximum time to wait in seconds (default: 2000.0)\r\n\r\n        backoff: Backoff strategy for polling intervals. Options:\r\n            - \"constant\": Keep the same polling interval\r\n"]
[145.700316, "o", "            - \"linear\": Increase interval by 1 second each poll (default)\r\n            - \"exponential\": Double the interval each poll\r\n\r\n"]
[145.700376, "o", "        verbose: Print progress indicators every 10 polls (default: False)\r\n\r\n\u001b[7m--More--\u001b[27m"]
